    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Familiar Friend Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase one ability score of your choice by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Battle Familiar.</strong> You always have @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.YIYID7BBimPO38ps]{Battle Familiar} prepared. You can cast it once without a spell slot, regaining that use when you finish a Long Rest; you can also cast it with any spell slots of the appropriate level you have. Its spellcasting ability is the one you chose for the Faithful Companion benefit of your Familiar Friend feat.</p><p><strong>Intercept Attack.</strong> When a creature within 5 feet of your familiar is hit by an attack roll, your familiar can take a Reaction to add your Proficiency Bonus to that creature's Armor Class against the attack, which can make it miss.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-eSAC7msam6wXbqHG\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Choose the spellcasting ability of your Familiar Friend feat.</p></section>",
